Tool colours in the rail (unselected): Files yellow, Search blue, GitHub text2, Terminal blue, Logcat
green, Problems orange, Settings textSoft. Selected tool: white icon on an accent tile.

File icons are chosen by the real file extension: code files (kt, java, ts, js, py, html, css, xml, json,
gradle) use the code icon in purple; folders use the folder icon in yellow; everything else uses the file
icon in blue. Use the app's existing extension mapping where it has one.



