Rules for every screen

1. Use the header, back button, rail, panel, list and button specs from Components with no
changes.

2. Never fill a list with sample items. Lists show what exists. Zero items show the empty state.
3. Loading shows a progress bar or skeleton lines in the field colour, never an empty white screen.
4. Errors show the real message from the system in a red line or card, with a Retry button when
retry makes sense.

5. Counts, sizes, times and names are formatted from real values. Times are relative ("2 min ago")
up to one day, then a date.

Screens that are not shown

This document does not show every screen. The app already works and has more features than the
pictures cover. Do not remove or hide any existing feature because it has no picture. Restyle it with
this design system so it looks like part of the same app.

Method for any screen

1. Find the closest pictured screen (a list, a form, a log, a settings page, a sheet) and copy its
structure.

2. Replace the header with the standard header: back button first, origin name in bold, current
name muted.



3. Page background is the content colour. Cards and groups use the field colour with radius 18.
Panels use the panel colour.

4. Replace every colour, font size, radius and spacing with the tokens in Design numbers. No
colours outside the table.

5. Replace icons with the ones in the Icons section. If a needed icon is missing, draw a new one in
the same style: 24 by 24 grid, stroke 2, round caps and joins, no fill.

6. Keep all existing logic, data and behaviour. Only the look changes.

Recipes

Kind of screen Build it like

List of items Panel row (tile 42, title, sub line, chevron) on the content colour

Settings or options Settings group cards with toggles, values and chevrons

Form Labelled text fields (44 tall), primary button at the bottom, 48 tall

Confirmation Confirm dialog, red button for destructive actions

Choice from a few options Bottom sheet with rows, or segmented control when 2 to 3

Long log or output Mono 12 sp on field colour, level colours from the syntax and status tokens

Progress Progress bar with label, Cancel button below

Permission or sign in Centred icon tile 64, title 19 sp / 800, text 13.5 sp muted, one primary button

Info or about Settings group with read only rows

Empty, loading and error states

State Look

Empty Centred tile 64 (radius 20, field colour, muted icon 28), title 16 sp / 700, one line 13 sp muted saying what
appears here, and the action button that creates the first item when one exists

Loadin Progress bar 6 tall or 3 to 5 skeleton rows in field colour
g

Error Red tint card (diffDelBg, radius 14, padding 12) with the real message in red, and a Retry button

Offline Same as error with a wifi-off icon and the text that the action needs network

Existing dialogs, toasts and notifications

Restyle them with Sheets and menus. Keep their text and behaviour. Android system dialogs that the
app cannot style stay as they are.

